+# Scope: sponsors page
+
+**For:** dev team · **Module:** `modules/sponsors`
+
+## Goal
+
+Show our sponsors on the club site, grouped by tier with gold first, each with
+the company's logo, so sponsors get the visibility we promise in the
+sponsorship package and the site stops needing hand edits every term.
+
+## Background
+
+- `modules/sponsors` is **planned**: it has a `module.json` and `MODULE.md` but
+  no code, no table, and no `verify` command. It has to become a working module
+  before the page can use it. `modules/events` is a good example to copy.
+- The `Sponsor` shape already exists as `SponsorSchema` in
+  `packages/schemas/src/club.ts`: `id`, `name`, optional `tier`, `websiteUrl`,
+  and `logoPath`. Use it; do not define a second one.
+- There is no site shell yet (`modules/site-core` is also planned), so this
+  work delivers the data and logic, not the page markup.
+
+## What to build
+
+1. Promote `modules/sponsors`: add `package.json` (`@clubkit/sponsors`),
+   `src/index.ts`, `src/sponsors.test.ts`, set `status` to `experimental`, and
+   set `verify` to `pnpm vitest run modules/sponsors`.
+2. `sponsorsByTier(sponsors, tierOrder)`: groups in `tierOrder` (e.g.
+   `["gold", "silver", "bronze"]`), sorted by name, empty tiers dropped, unknown
+   or missing tiers last under "other".
+3. `migrations/0001_sponsors.sql`: a `public.sponsors` table with RLS, a
+   public read policy for `anon`, and writes revoked (service role only).
+4. Logos: store a path in `logo_path`, pointing at a public storage bucket.
+5. Update `MODULE.md` and `module.json` exports, then run `pnpm catalog`.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- The page layout and styling (waits on `site-core`).
+- An admin UI for editing sponsors; execs edit rows in Supabase for now.
+- Sponsorship package pricing.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- [ ] Sponsors come back grouped by tier, gold first, sorted by name within a tier.
+- [ ] Sponsors without a known tier appear last, not dropped.
+- [ ] Anyone can read sponsors with the anon key; nobody without the service role can write.
+- [ ] Every sponsor shown can have a logo.
+- [ ] `pnpm verify sponsors`, `pnpm validate`, and `pnpm check` pass.
+
+## How to verify
+
+`pnpm verify sponsors` while working, `pnpm catalog` after editing the manifest,
+and `pnpm check` before review.
+
+## Open questions
+
+- Which tiers do we sell this year besides gold? Assumed: gold, silver, bronze.
+- Where do logo files come from, and what size? Assumed: PNG or SVG uploaded by an exec.
